`data/gazetteer.json.gz` is a reduction of the GeoNames cities1000,
admin1CodesASCII, countryInfo and alternateNamesV2 exports, holding only the
name, alternate spellings, country, first-level division, centre point and
population of each place. `scripts/build-gazetteer.ts` regenerates it:

    npm run build:gazetteer

The switchboard resolves locations from this file in-process. No geocoding
service is called at run time.
